§§ `Paragraph 6 -- section 14 as it stood for a contract made before 18 May 1973`

-- paragraph 6, s 14(1).
-- src:1769 | 6. In relation to a contract made before 18 May 1973, substitute the following for
-- src:1770 | section 14:
-- src:1774 | 14.—(1) Subject to this and any other Act, there is no implied
-- src:1775 | condition or warranty about the quality or fitness for any particular
-- src:1776 | purpose of goods supplied under a contract of sale.
@ref sch para 6 s 14(1) (src:1769-1770) (src:1774-1776)
