    WHEN `whether the buyer knew or ought reasonably to have known of the existence and extent of the term, having regard, among other things, to any custom of the trade and any previous course of dealing between the parties` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `where the term exempts from all or any of the provisions of section 13, 14 or 15 if some condition is not complied with, whether it was reasonable at the time of the contract to expect that compliance with that condition would be practicable` THEN JUST TRUE
