-- src:190 | after (but not to those made before) 1 January 1894.
-- src:1706 | 5. In relation to a contract made on or after 18 May 1973 and before 19 May
-- src:1707 | 1985, substitute the following for section 14:
-- src:1769 | 6. In relation to a contract made before 18 May 1973, substitute the following for
-- src:1770 | section 14:
